Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-08T17:03:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T09:57:38Z","closed_at":"2025-02-10T09:50:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102590","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102590.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102590.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-10T09:50:52Z"},"body":"This PR introduces a **Snackbar UI component**, providing a **native, touch-friendly in-app notification system**. The Snackbar is designed to display **temporary messages** without blocking user interaction and includes an **optional action button**. It can be dismissed after a certain duration or by swiping.\r\n\r\nI would like to integrate this into some parts of the Android Editor. However, since we are currently in a *feature freeze*, this PR only adds the component itself without exposing it or integrating it into the Android Editor yet. The integration will be done in follow-up PRs as needed during the **4.5 dev cycle**.\r\n\r\nCurrently, this Snackbar is needed for and will be used in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102492.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cce39cd-9139-4fd9-ab27-71a005eafe77\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a